#   pos 0.00641584, rot 0.013188124, vel 0.0435116775, angvel 0.06831265,
#   awake delta 0. Tolerances are twice the measured maximum; angvel shares vel.
expect pos 0.01283168 rot 0.026376248 vel 0.1366253 horizon 180 counts exact
world gravity 0 -10 0 dt 1 60 substeps 4 steps 180
body static position 0 -0.5 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0
